issuer_sourced:            # 2343 — the price-leg re-pin (NAV anchor 0.4297 unchanged)
  "2343":
    nav_per_share_usd: 0.4297      # 2026 Interim issuer-composite, 30-Jun — UNCHANGED
    price_leg: >
      Promote the NEWEST HK close in prices_daily at promote time — 8/28 close $0.5326
      (HK$4.175 x 0.12756) as of this draft. The ±30% guard has been TRIPPED since 8/18
      (static 0.390, +36.6% at the 8/28 close) — the name is on stale-static fallback and
      its current HOLD print is the guard artifact, not the market (true tape read ~T/S
      at a ~24% premium to issuer NAV).
    pnav_rule: >
      consensus_pnav = promoted_price / 0.4297, computed at promote — never pasted.
      At $0.5326 that is 1.24 (was 0.91 at the stale $0.390).
    fwd_pe_rule: >
      RECOMPUTE: price / FY2026 consensus EPS US$0.03 -> ~17.8x at $0.5326 (the price leg
      moves, so the ratio moves with it — the 8/18 draft's reasoning carries).
    per_class_refinement: >
      RIDER (digest 8/24 M3 + owner summary #4): the 8/21 Interim REPORT publishes the
      per-class split of the SAME 2,070.6 aggregate (Handysize 58/952.6 · Supra-Ultra
      48/1,100.0 · Cape-bareboat 1/18.0, ex-NBs) — a free resolution upgrade at an
      unchanged anchor; retires the "needs AR2026 ~Mar-2027" watchlist comment. Fold the
      comment rewrite into this promote. ALSO note the H1 buyback (~9.5M sh for ~$3.5M,
      programme up to $40M): verify whether the 5,165.247803M derivation count is the
      30-Jun count (post-buyback) before re-deriving anything — recompute, never edit.
